{
  "schema": "v12-pure-ppo-curriculum-v1",
  "description": "V12.1 debug-first direct CTBR PPO recovery: near static -> static -> low tail; randomized orientation, active pursuer closure reward, asinh relative state, chase-aware model selection. No teacher, LSTM, BC, or safe Cost Critic.",
